          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oba bwe nsindika endwaire ya kawumpuli mu nsi eyo, ni ngimaliraku obusungu bwange okwita abantu n'ensolo okumaliriragho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noa ni Danieli ni Yobu ni bwe bandigibairemu, nze Musengwa Katonda ndayira nti nga bwendi omulamu, tibandiwoniizaagho waire abaana baibwe. Bandiwoniizaagho bwa bulamu bwaibwe bwonka olw'obutuufu bwaibwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
