        },
        {
          "text": " Agho ni Musengwa Katonda akoba ati: “Bwenebwene tikirisingagho inho bwe ndisindika ku Yerusalemu ebibonerezo byange ebina ebikakali: olutalo, endhala, ensolo edh'akabi, n'endwaire ya kawumpuli, okuja okukiitamu abantu n'ensolo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
